            "detailed_description": "The Beginner's Guide is a narrative video game from Davey Wreden, the creator of <i>The Stanley Parable</i>. It lasts about an hour and a half and has no traditional mechanics, no goals or objectives. Instead, it tells the story of a person struggling to deal with something they do not understand.",
